# Build artifacts
/target
**/target
**/*.rs.bk

# Cargo.lock intentionally not ignored at the workspace root for binaries
# (best practice for application crates per Cargo's official guidance).
# Comment this out if your policy is "no Cargo.lock in libraries".

# Local dev certs (DEVELOPMENT.md §3) — never commit
/dev-pki/
/dev-pki/**
*.crt
*.key
*.csr
*.pem

# Editor / OS noise
.DS_Store
.idea/
.vscode/
.kilo/
*.swp

# Benchmark results (PERFORMANCE.md §3)
benches/results/

# Fuzz corpora — they grow without bound
fuzz/corpus/

# Hide all markdown files except README.md and CLAUDE.md
*.md
**/*.md
!README.md
!CLAUDE.md


